(6. Conflict Resolution) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6.1 Constitutional conflict rules) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Conflicting evidence must be represented, not discarded.) Tj
T*
(2. Source trust affects weighting but cannot erase contradictions.) Tj
T*
(3. Recent strong evidence may outweigh stale evidence, but stale evidence remains in history.) Tj
T*
(4. Context matters: failure in exams may contradict academic mastery but not necessarily ) Tj
T*
(practical project capability.) Tj
T*
(5. High-impact contradictions require human review.) Tj
T*
(6. Jurisdiction-specific conflicts are resolved through overlays, not global semantic changes.) Tj
T*
(7. Conflicting AI models do not vote by popularity; they trigger uncertainty analysis.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6.2 Scenario rules) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(| Scenario | Reasoning rule |) Tj
T*
(|---|---|) Tj
T*
(| Excellent grades but poor portfolio | Separate assessment performance from artifact/project capability. Lower ) Tj
T*
(confidence in applied capability until portfolio evidence improves. |) Tj
T*
(| Excellent GitHub but failed exams | Recognize practical engineering evidence while representing academic knowledge ) Tj
T*
(gaps. Do not collapse both into one score. |) Tj
T*
(| Employer praises but assessments disagree | Weight employer evidence for workplace context; inspect bias, ) Tj
T*
(specificity, and role relevance. Trigger review if passport claim affected. |) Tj
T*
(| Outdated certifications vs recent projects | Expired certifications lose current verification strength; recent ) Tj
T*
(strong project evidence may support current capability separately. |) Tj
T*
(| Conflicting AI models | Compare evidence references, ontology mappings, calibration, and uncertainty. Do not average) Tj
T*
( blindly. |) Tj
T*
(| Multiple institutions | Preserve institution provenance and assessment validity differences. Normalize through ) Tj
T*
(ontology, not grade equivalence alone. |) Tj
T*
(| Different jurisdictions | Apply jurisdiction overlays for regulated capabilities and credentials. Global capability ) Tj
T*
(may remain while local eligibility differs. |) Tj
T*
() Tj
