(8.2 Human review principles) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Reviewers must see supporting and conflicting evidence.) Tj
T*
(2. Review decisions must include rationale.) Tj
T*
(3. Reviews create new canonical events.) Tj
T*
(4. Reviews can override AI confidence but cannot delete history.) Tj
T*
(5. High-impact reviews require reviewer identity, role, timestamp, and policy basis.) Tj
T*
(6. Student-visible decisions must provide challenge/appeal path where appropriate.) Tj
T*
